{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126101331945-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126110253\"/><p>現場為康盈苑一單位。</p><p>今晨(26日)7時19分，藍田碧雲道225號康盈苑一單位，姓嚴(46歲)男住戶在上址懷疑暈倒，女友報案求助。救援人員接報到場，經檢驗後證實氣絕身亡。警員調查後，列作「屍體發現」跟進，事主死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:19:46.435336+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:13:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:15:25.127161+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:13:02.465414+00:00","content_hash":"1c9e20ecadec7faea9fb07122e1e92113c04e78d70c6aa5dac839c99859bf256","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}